# double_free_scan's per-slot state bytes (heap/slotstate.rs): a byte
# array outside every verified invariant. The verified wrappers (free,
# claim, pop, release, the batch loops, check_not_cached) only turn what
# these return into aborts (`abort_pending`); none changes what the
# verified paths do.

# The reservation and the commits: mmap and mprotect of the arrays.
init	FFI/syscall	none (assumption)
commit	FFI/syscall	none (assumption)

# The transition (a read when `from` is `NONE`): the byte's address from the slot index
# (below the watermark that the commit precedes), then relaxed loads and
# stores of one AtomicU8, and for a free one compare-and-exchange
# (tests/loom/src/slotstate.rs models that race).
step	atomics primitive	loom/GenMC
